    <string name="mods_tab_shaders">Shaders</string>
    <string name="mods_desc_mods">Horizon content mods (.hmod): blocks, items, textures and data. Code mods (WebAssembly, like Compass Enhanced) do not run in this Horizon version yet. Fabric and NeoForge .jar files do not run in Horizon.</string>
    <string name="mods_desc_resource">Java Edition resource packs (.zip with pack.mcmeta).</string>
    <string name="mods_desc_shaders">Horizon\'s own shader packs (.hshader) run. Classic OptiFine/Iris .zip packs are listed but not rendered yet: Horizon has no GLSL pipeline for them.</string>
